/E (This report answers all five questions of Lab 3 \(50 marks\). A 100-row cyber-activity dataset \(simple_cyber_activity.csv\) is split and standardised, a 4-8-4-1 dense neural network is trained for 20 epochs, its learning curves and test accuracy are interpreted, and it is compared with a Decision Tree. All numbers and graphs below come from an actual run of the code shown \(TensorFlow 2.21, scikit-learn 1.9, seed 42\).)
/Pg 10 0 R
