/T (Note on the dataset: the lab manual refers to a prepared file that was not supplied, so I generated a balanced 100-row dataset with the same four features and label \(50 Normal, 50 Attack\) using a fixed random seed. Attack records are drawn with more failed logins, odd login hours, more new devices and larger transfers, with overlap between classes so the task is not trivial. Because of this, exact accuracies differ from the manual's sample figures \(about 76% / 88%\); the manual itself says results may vary.)
