365 0 obj
<<
/Title (Each record is a flat row of four numeric features \(failed logins, login hour, new device, data transferred\). There is no image grid for a CNN to scan and no ordered sequence for an LSTM to remember, and no need to generate data. A small fully connected network is the simplest model that can learn combinations of these features, and it trains in seconds on 75 rows.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 315 0 R
>>
endobj
