368 0 obj
<<
/Title (The label uses 0 = Normal and 1 = Attack. The dataset has 50 records of each class, and stratify=y keeps that balance in both the 75-row training set and the 25-row test set. Normalization: StandardScaler rescales every feature to mean 0 and standard deviation 1, so that data_transfer_mb \(values in the hundreds\) does not dominate new_device \(0 or 1\) only because of its size. The scaler is fitted on the training data alone and then reused on the test set and on new records, so no information from the test set leaks into training.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 317 0 R
>>
endobj
