422 0 obj
<<
/Title (Learning. Training loss falls steadily from 0.638 to 0.376, and training accuracy rises from 75% to 91.7%. Validation loss also falls smoothly \(to 0.299\) and validation accuracy settles at 93.3%. Both loss curves are still going down at epoch 20, so the network has learned useful structure and could improve with a few more epochs.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 372 0 R
/First 468 0 R
